  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Infer metabolite secretion from enzyme expression, diffuse it with a reaction-diffusion model over the tissue spots, score metabolite-receptor interactions, deconvolve spots into cell types and build a cell-type communication network, starting from a spatial AnnData (.h5ad) file or a built-in demo. Data used in the run: example. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
